WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.812
Job-ready Pandas means being confident with a focused set of patterns.

00:00:05.812 --> 00:00:13.397
First, you should be able to load tabular data from a CSV file, spreadsheet-like source, or database result.

00:00:13.397 --> 00:00:22.217
Next, you should inspect rows, columns, data types, missing values, and duplicates before changing anything.

00:00:22.217 --> 00:00:29.677
Then you need to know how to select the data you need, clean incorrect values, create useful new columns,

00:00:29.677 --> 00:00:33.482
summarize categories, combine related tables, and verify the outcome.

00:00:33.482 --> 00:00:37.802
Notice that verification is part of the workflow.

00:00:37.802 --> 00:00:46.562
We do not assume that a cleaning step or merge worked correctly simply because Python did not produce an error.

00:00:46.562 --> 00:00:52.736
The objective is fluency with the workflow, not memorization of every available function.
